{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:94d3cc3fd452d5afaa3358b0934e3ae194020f9dedbac5439fa3213ea0fd0b42",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0c8aee07825c442f2f8f63765a7ffd5212eba374eb0532696c70fccdb70cc87",
      "text": "马上就要迎来生日的志狼。\n坚信肯定有人在为自己筹划生日会的他，\n悄悄打探直央等人的动向，却完全没有任何痕迹。\n面对一如既往毫无异样的大家，志狼垂头丧气，然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a8c0dfea0574787a91afb0d1a77d542014a6c641f038c19f6eb83d3e5e672f1",
      "text": "志狼君该不会\n察觉到生日派对的事了吧……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a06272369dd74e367aa2e324365808b20b947e99e815db2c2bd7f61566bd808",
      "text": "虽然可能察觉到要办派对，\n但具体内容肯定还没暴露哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16e6e0de1bcd3ecb3df65ab4e03938854fc5994ae2e16f375acd54ef90bb3d3c",
      "text": "那么，就办一场比志狼君想象中\n还要厉害得多的派对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d135e93382b8a9fdd90e544368ae14d6eae4534cee13858305eb79320102cbb",
      "text": "嗯，说得对。\n办一场格外“Big”的派对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:504c21776fa65eaa042ac525d05e9c69474a0336d8b9ff5febb4cfb98974db91",
      "text": "呵呵♪非常适合志狼君的\n“Big”派对呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa61be3a6bdf0f444d50205b25bb38e6597a392c3c44c18f5feb0739c0edc90",
      "text": "啊——啊，明明探听了那么多次，\n派对的事我却完——全没发现啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:510783c027aef87dfe421d76724370af3a5872b1db27c2fd49a921f3c1435e88",
      "text": "直央，你这家伙。比花音那次的时候\n装作不知道的技术更精湛了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf2ba40ff58a5694e6aa6c10e1b2b304afae14d19beaf745e7c6ea6e2341dad2",
      "text": "能被志狼君这么说……好开心啊。\n努力总算没有白费。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e3f7db723b67e070807f096e16eb055d2d82e40b4fb84ff66e3e76bdb116474",
      "text": "惊喜能顺利成功真的松了一口气呢。\n志狼君，玩得开心吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac32e73a085f3f67b57679874759edb4b9c6908a304d8d86c32d519685e6e295",
      "text": "噢！真的吓了一跳，所以相对地玩得\n超级开心！等下也要向老哥炫耀一番！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1321ca2768264f85ba68f21e31b13af0d99c7a6ce78bb22b9cafa0cb2876de22",
      "text": "志狼君，刚才的舞蹈好厉害呀～。\n我觉得是至今为止跳得最好的一次！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a68f32305dafb96b7f404f37ebd1340362c9d27fb749591dccc9cb29f3ebab",
      "text": "哼哼，那当然。\n我要是拿出真本事，差不多就是这水平！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25b51e8fbae4a5accc6dd2d7c41176738ab8069cdeb2463ac147e64faa0b9d7c",
      "text": "今天的我，比起去年，不对，\n比起昨天的我还要更加Big哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c33b5511d33849d80b1e1a43e06f31b5e3d5b65cac8a4c2c440511ae878b272",
      "text": "前不久生日的是直央君，在那之前是花音。\n这样一来大家都变Big了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51d47eb0c5fa699c4b6d097cbdfbec1873320959a0e34787242aeb0f8a928d5e",
      "text": "もふもふえん今后也要变得\n更加可爱、更加帅气哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
